-- MANA LINE — 0037_seed_locations_andhra_pradesh.sql
--
-- Real Andhra Pradesh village/pincode data, split from the full India
-- Post pincode directory by the user (Python-processed CSV, 10,681 raw
-- rows for this state).
--
-- DATA QUALITY FINDINGS (verified by inspection, not assumed):
-- 1. The source's "mandal" column is NOT real mandal data — it has only
--    30 distinct values, every one of which spans MULTIPLE districts
--    (e.g. "Rajahmundry" appears under both Konaseema and East Godavari
--    district). A real mandal belongs to exactly one district, so this
--    column is actually the OLD pre-2022 revenue division name, one
--    administrative level coarser than mandal, not corrected in this
--    dataset after AP's 2022 reorganization (13 -> 26 districts).
-- 2. The source's "district" column IS correct: 26 distinct values,
--    matching AP's real current district count post-reorganization.
-- 3. Fallback applied (per master-chat decision): mandal = district
--    value, since no genuine mandal-level source was available. This is
--    honest and non-misleading (never presents the obsolete division
--    name as if it were a real mandal) — replace with real mandal data
--    later if a proper source becomes available.
-- 4. area_type: this source has no village/town distinction at all
--    (single generic "village" column) — defaulted to 'Village' for
--    every row, matching the source's own literal column name. Not
--    verified per-row; flagged, not silently presented as authoritative.
-- 5. 1 exact duplicate (pin_code+village) row found and dropped.
-- 6. 2 rows overlap with already-seeded test data (Someswaram/533261,
--    Srikalahasti/517644) — corrected via UPDATE below instead of
--    duplicate INSERT, since the original test seed (0032) used
--    pre-reorganization district names (East Godavari/Chittoor) that
--    this real data now confirms are outdated for these two villages.
--
-- Row count: 10,678 new INSERTs + 2 corrective UPDATEs = 10,680 of the
-- 10,681 raw source rows accounted for (1 duplicate dropped).

-- Correct the 2 already-seeded test rows to their real post-2022 district.
UPDATE locations SET mandal = 'Konaseema', district = 'Konaseema'
  WHERE pin_code = '533261' AND village_town_name = 'Someswaram';
UPDATE locations SET mandal = 'Tirupati', district = 'Tirupati'
  WHERE pin_code = '517644' AND village_town_name = 'Srikalahasti';

